            "detailed_description": "This is elaine! A minimalistic tile-matching action game by Slight Super Powers. Frantically guiding your player tile around a sensile platform to match the incoming pattern in time. In this deceptively simple game, you'll have to deal with a shifting screen, multi-colored patterns of increasing speed and complexity, and an unrelenting countdown timer synced to brain-pumping music.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>six uniquely challenging levels<br></li><li>highly addictive gameplay<br></li><li>pulsing electronic soundtrack<br></li><li>minimalistic game design<br></li><li>obsessive global leaderboards<br></li><li>accurate pantone color reproduction<br></li><li>non-stop action</li></ul>",
